00:10:10.167 --> 00:10:12.968
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:10:12.968 --> 00:10:15.701
If you looked at that signature
without knowing who it was,

00:10:15.701 --> 00:10:16.534
you'd think the name was

00:10:16.534 --> 00:10:17.734
Ahhhhhhh!

00:10:17.734 --> 00:10:21.167
[ Laughter ]

00:10:21.167 --> 00:10:23.767
These two moments should
give you a pretty good idea

00:10:23.767 --> 00:10:25.334
of where the Republican Party
is right now.

00:10:25.334 --> 00:10:27.801
It's an unhinged movement
of aspiring authoritarians

00:10:27.801 --> 00:10:30.000
whose leader is openly
praising a brutal tyrant

00:10:30.000 --> 00:10:32.667
and asking him, once again,
to intervene in U.S. politics,

00:10:32.667 --> 00:10:34.834
while a congressman
accuses his colleagues

00:10:34.834 --> 00:10:36.267
of drug-fueled sex parties.

00:10:36.267 --> 00:10:39.000
I have no idea what those orgies
look like, but I'm guessing...

00:10:39.000 --> 00:10:40.267
-It's like a pyramid.

00:10:40.267 --> 00:10:43.234
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:10:49.801 --> 00:10:51.734
-This has been "A Closer Look."

00:10:51.734 --> 00:10:54.567
♪♪

00:10:54.567 --> 00:10:56.200
God's Love We Deliver
cooks and brings

00:10:56.200 --> 00:10:57.501
